§ `s 445.2 cetaceans`
#ASSERT `s 445.2(1) the animal is a cetacean` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 445.2(1) the animal is a cetacean` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 445.2(1) the animal is a cetacean` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING       -- "includes": the list is not closed
-- inputs of (2.1): the paragraph; gestating on the day of coming into force; that day; first day of the gestation period; last day of the period; the day of the act
`ccc13 test the coming into force` MEANS Date 15 3 2020
`ccc13 test the period starts` MEANS Date 1 1 2020
`ccc13 test the period ends` MEANS Date 1 9 2020
#ASSERT `s 445.2(2.1) paragraphs (2)(b) and (c) do not apply in respect of the cetacean` `s 445.2(2)(b) breeds or impregnates a cetacean` TRUE `ccc13 test the coming into force` `ccc13 test the period starts` `ccc13 test the period ends` (Date 10 5 2020) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 445.2(2.1) paragraphs (2)(b) and (c) do not apply in respect of the cetacean` `s 445.2(2)(c) possesses or seeks to obtain reproductive materials of cetaceans, including sperm or an embryo` TRUE `ccc13 test the coming into force` `ccc13 test the period starts` `ccc13 test the period ends` (Date 10 5 2020) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 445.2(2.1) paragraphs (2)(b) and (c) do not apply in respect of the cetacean` `s 445.2(2)(b) breeds or impregnates a cetacean` TRUE `ccc13 test the coming into force` `ccc13 test the period starts` `ccc13 test the period ends` (Date 1 1 2020) EQUALS JUST TRUE         -- the first day of the period
#ASSERT `s 445.2(2.1) paragraphs (2)(b) and (c) do not apply in respect of the cetacean` `s 445.2(2)(b) breeds or impregnates a cetacean` TRUE `ccc13 test the coming into force` `ccc13 test the period starts` `ccc13 test the period ends` (Date 1 9 2020) EQUALS JUST TRUE         -- the last day of the period
#ASSERT `s 445.2(2.1) paragraphs (2)(b) and (c) do not apply in respect of the cetacean` `s 445.2(2)(b) breeds or impregnates a cetacean` TRUE `ccc13 test the coming into force` `ccc13 test the period starts` `ccc13 test the period ends` (Date 2 9 2020) EQUALS JUST FALSE        -- one day after the period
#ASSERT `s 445.2(2.1) paragraphs (2)(b) and (c) do not apply in respect of the cetacean` `s 445.2(2)(b) breeds or impregnates a cetacean` TRUE `ccc13 test the coming into force` `ccc13 test the period starts` `ccc13 test the period ends` (Date 31 12 2019) EQUALS JUST FALSE       -- one day before the period
#ASSERT `s 445.2(2.1) paragraphs (2)(b) and (c) do not apply in respect of the cetacean` `s 445.2(2)(b) breeds or impregnates a cetacean` TRUE `ccc13 test the coming into force` (Date 16 3 2020) `ccc13 test the period ends` (Date 10 5 2020) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the period does not include the day of coming into force
#ASSERT `s 445.2(2.1) paragraphs (2)(b) and (c) do not apply in respect of the cetacean` `s 445.2(2)(b) breeds or impregnates a cetacean` FALSE `ccc13 test the coming into force` `ccc13 test the period starts` `ccc13 test the period ends` (Date 10 5 2020) EQUALS JUST FALSE     -- not gestating on that day
#ASSERT `s 445.2(2.1) paragraphs (2)(b) and (c) do not apply in respect of the cetacean` `s 445.2(2)(a) owns, has the custody of or controls a cetacean that is kept in captivity` TRUE `ccc13 test the coming into force` `ccc13 test the period starts` `ccc13 test the period ends` (Date 10 5 2020) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 445.2(2.2) paragraph (2)(a) does not apply to the offspring of a cetacean` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 445.2(2.2) paragraph (2)(a) does not apply to the offspring of a cetacean` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 445.2(2.2) paragraph (2)(a) does not apply to the offspring of a cetacean` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE         -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was `s 445.2(2.2) paragraph (2)(a) does not apply to the offspring of a cetacean` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING; fork F12: the exception functions of s 445.2 now answer JUST FALSE for "no exception on these facts", so that the offence of subsection (2), which reads each exception through `ccc13 not`, can be JUST TRUE; an animal that is not the offspring of a cetacean gets no exception from (2.2)
#ASSERT `s 445.2(3) paragraph (2)(a) does not apply to the person` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 445.2(3) paragraph (2)(a) does not apply to the person` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 445.2(3) paragraph (2)(a) does not apply to the person` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 445.2(3) paragraph (2)(a) does not apply to the person` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE         -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was `s 445.2(3) paragraph (2)(a) does not apply to the person` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING; fork F12: a person in none of the three cases has no exception from this subsection (same reason as (2.2))
#ASSERT `s 445.2(3.1) subsection (2) does not apply to the person` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 445.2(3.1) subsection (2) does not apply to the person` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE         -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was `s 445.2(3.1) subsection (2) does not apply to the person` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING; fork F12: a person who is not conducting licensed scientific research has no exception from this subsection (same reason as (2.2))
-- inputs of (2): the animal is a cetacean (s 445.2(1)); (a) owns, has the custody of or controls; (b) breeds or impregnates; (c) reproductive materials; the exceptions of (2.1), (2.2), (3) and (3.1)
